    "text": "<math><mfrac><mrow><mn>(1</mn><mo>+</mo><mrow><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">tan</mi></mrow><mo>&#8289;</mo><mrow><mi>x</mi><mo>+</mo><mrow><mrow><msup><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">tan</mi></mrow><mrow><mn>2</mn></mrow></msup></mrow><mo>&#8289;</mo><mrow><mi>x</mi><mo>)</mo><mo>(</mo><mn>1</mn><mo>+</mo><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">t</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">a</mi><msup><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">n</mi></mrow><mrow><mn>2</mn></mrow></msup><mi>x</mi><mo>-</mo><mrow><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">tan</mi></mrow><mo>&#8289;</mo><mrow><mi>x</mi><mo>)</mo></mrow></mrow></mrow></mrow></mrow></mrow></mrow><mrow><mrow><mrow><msup><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">tan</mi></mrow><mrow><mn>2</mn></mrow></msup></mrow><mo>&#8289;</mo><mrow><mi>x</mi></mrow></mrow></mrow></mfrac><mo>&#62;</mo><mn>0</mn></math><br /><br /><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mo>&#8658;</mo><mi>&#160;</mi><mfrac><mrow><msup><mfenced><mrow><mn>1</mn><mo>+</mo><msup><mi>tan</mi><mn>2</mn></msup><mo>&#8289;</mo><mi>x</mi></mrow></mfenced><mn>2</mn></msup><mo>-</mo><msup><mi>tan</mi><mn>2</mn></msup><mo>&#8289;</mo><mi>x</mi></mrow><mrow><msup><mi>tan</mi><mn>2</mn></msup><mo>&#8289;</mo><mi>x</mi></mrow></mfrac><mo>&#62;</mo><mn>0</mn></math><br /><br />Since, <math><mn>1</mn><mo>+</mo><mrow><mrow><msup><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">tan</mi></mrow><mrow><mn>2</mn></mrow></msup></mrow><mo>&#8289;</mo><mrow><mi>x</mi><mo>&#62;</mo><mrow><mrow><msup><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">tan</mi></mrow><mrow><mn>2</mn></mrow></msup></mrow><mo>&#8289;</mo><mrow><mi>x</mi><mo>,</mo><mi>&#160;</mi><mo>&#8704;</mo><mi>x</mi></mrow></mrow></mrow></mrow></math> <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mo>&#8712;</mo><mi>R</mi><mo>-</mo><mfenced open=\"{\" close=\"}\" separators=\"|\"><mrow><mi>x</mi><mo>=</mo><mfrac><mrow><mi>n</mi><mi>&#960;</mi></mrow><mn>2</mn></mfrac><mo>,</mo><mi>&#160;</mi><mi>n</mi><mo>&#8712;</mo><mi>I</mi></mrow></mfenced></math><br /><br />Hence, given expression is positive for all values of <math><mi>x</mi></math> <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mo>&#8712;</mo><mi>R</mi><mo>-</mo><mfenced open=\"{\" close=\"}\" separators=\"|\"><mrow><mi>x</mi><mo>=</mo><mfrac><mrow><mi>n</mi><mi>&#960;</mi></mrow><mn>2</mn></mfrac><mo>,</mo><mi>&#160;</mi><mi>n</mi><mo>&#8712;</mo><mi>I</mi></mrow></mfenced></math>",
